222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Once you are done, you will be presented with a confirmation page, which you need to print and bring with you on the day of your U.S. visa interview. Without the DS-160 form confirmation, you will be unable to attend your interview.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You must pay the B1 visa fee to continue with your application. In addition to the application fee, you might also need to pay other fees, such as visa issuance fees. The amount of visa issuance fees depends on the relationship between your home country and the U.S. After paying all fees, make sure to save the receipts to attach to your documents.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
