/K [8]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You should schedule an appointment for your visa interview at the U.S. Embassy or Consulate in the country where you live. You may also schedule your interview at another U.S. Embassy or Consulate where you will be present; however, be aware that it may be more difficult to demonstrate your qualifications for a visa outside of the country where you live.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
