<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The DS-160 form is valid for 30 days from the day you start completing it. For example, if you start applying on January 1, the DS-160 form will expire by January 31. Make sure you complete the form on time, or you will need to start it from the beginning.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
