425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The DS-160 confirmation number is the number you receive once you complete, sign, and submit the form. This number serves as confirmation that you have completed this step.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
